{"5380550":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"DROPANIC","steam_appid":5380550,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5384850],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two falling-piece puzzles. One controller.<br>Can you play both at once?<\/h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/1b4e8f9232707f4d9ed02ec9a749cf31.avif?t=1793109409\" width=1170 height=1020 \/><\/span><br><br>DROPANIC is a single-player puzzle game where one set of controls moves every active board together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's give it a try.<\/h2><br>Clear block lines. Chain matching jewels.<br>Move. Rotate. Drop. Both boards, together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/dfe7159c666529537582c01002006e40.poster.avif?t=1793109409\" width=500 height=410 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/dfe7159c666529537582c01002006e40.webm?t=1793109409\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/dfe7159c666529537582c01002006e40.mp4?t=1793109409\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Got it? Now try four.<\/h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/833431230e456817e130a247fbb2b9cf.avif?t=1793109409\" width=1170 height=658 \/><\/span><br><br>Still just one controller.<br>Keep every board alive. If any one fills up, the run ends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your challenge.<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Stages<\/strong> — 88 stages. Complete all five missions to clear each one.<br><\/li><li><strong>Endless<\/strong> — Choose 2–4 boards and your starting speed. Chase your personal best as the pace rises.<br><\/li><li><strong>Random Challenge<\/strong> — Two boards. Five random missions. Reroll before you start.<\/li><\/ul><br>Play with a keyboard or controller. Supports 17 languages, including English and Japanese.<br><br><strong>Think you can? Let's find out.<\/strong><br>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two falling-piece puzzles. One controller.<br>Can you play both at once?<\/h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/1b4e8f9232707f4d9ed02ec9a749cf31.avif?t=1793109409\" width=1170 height=1020 \/><\/span><br><br>DROPANIC is a single-player puzzle game where one set of controls moves every active board together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's give it a try.<\/h2><br>Clear block lines. Chain matching jewels.<br>Move. Rotate. Drop. Both boards, together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/dfe7159c666529537582c01002006e40.poster.avif?t=1793109409\" width=500 height=410 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/dfe7159c666529537582c01002006e40.webm?t=1793109409\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/dfe7159c666529537582c01002006e40.mp4?t=1793109409\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Got it? Now try four.<\/h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/extras\/833431230e456817e130a247fbb2b9cf.avif?t=1793109409\" width=1170 height=658 \/><\/span><br><br>Still just one controller.<br>Keep every board alive. If any one fills up, the run ends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your challenge.<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Stages<\/strong> — 88 stages. Complete all five missions to clear each one.<br><\/li><li><strong>Endless<\/strong> — Choose 2–4 boards and your starting speed. Chase your personal best as the pace rises.<br><\/li><li><strong>Random Challenge<\/strong> — Two boards. Five random missions. Reroll before you start.<\/li><\/ul><br>Play with a keyboard or controller. Supports 17 languages, including English and Japanese.<br><br><strong>Think you can? Let's find out.<\/strong><br>","short_description":"Two falling-piece puzzles. One controller. Can you play both at once? Move, rotate and drop across every board together. Clear block lines and chain jewels, then take on up to four boards in this single-player puzzle challenge.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Dutch, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/5679470149b8f0851f74879d3a56898dd7a9ddf9\/header.jpg?t=1793109409","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/a6be3101e4ae1690d2693830c02bdb34ef7e1109\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793109409","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5380550\/a6be3101e4ae1690d2693830c02bdb34ef7e1109\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793109409","website":"https:\/\/dropanic.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit dual-core processor with SSE4.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible graphics<br